{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.99:0.4"], "en": "Uttiya Thera’s Verse:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.99:1.1", "PA_thag_1.99:1.2"], "en": "“Having heard a sound, mindfulness was lost by one who attends to a pleasing sign.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.99:1.3"], "en": "With a mind full of lust he experiences it,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.99:1.4"], "en": "and he persists by adhering to it;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.99:1.5"], "en": "his taints increase.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.99:1.6"], "en": "“Those who have entered into saṃsāra.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
